{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:69126","published":"2026-09-21T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-09-22T12:00:03.509575489Z","related":["CVE-2026-8458","CVE-2026-8927"],"summary":"Important: curl security update","details":"The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * curl: libcurl: Unauthorized connection reuse due to a logical error (CVE-2026-8458)\n  * curl: Information disclosure due to uncleared proxy authentication state (CVE-2026-8927)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"curl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/curl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.76.1-40.el9_8.7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:69126.json"}},{"package":{"name":"curl-minimal","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/curl-minimal"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.76.1-40.el9_8.7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:69126.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.76.1-40.el9_8.7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:69126.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/libcurl-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.76.1-40.el9_8.7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaL